51, 50, 50); font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;"><i><font color="#000000"><br></font></i></strong></div><div><strong style="color: rgb(51, 50, 50); font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;"><i><font color="#000000">SUNSHINE IN A JAR!</font></i></strong><br></div><p style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; text-align: inherit!important;">Can be used day &amp; night on the face for sensitive skin and all skin types!<br></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1542792009192" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1542792009192"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p><b>Please note:</b> This is an oil moisturizer and not a cream or chemical base so you only need a VERY little bit for it to yield full benefits!<br><br></p><p>*An everyday face moisturizer that can be applied anytime to balance, calm, &amp; hydrate the skin - and give your face a glow! Can be applied in the am before sunscreen and make up and/or before bed after you've washed your face. (Check out the additional info below for all its uses!)</p><p><br></p><p><b>NO FILLERS JUST NUTRIENTS - CHECK OUT OUR INGREDIENTS BELOW!</b></p></div></div><div data-label="Accordion" id="m-1585856959285" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-accordion" data-ver="2" data-id="1585856959285"><div data-accordion-group="" class="module " data-opendefault="0" data-opentab="1" data-single="1" data-bordercolor="#cecece" data-bordersize="1px"><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="1" data-key="content" class="plus iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1585856959285-1" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1585856959285-1" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><p><b>INGREDIENTS</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="1" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1585857026315" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1585857026315"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><b>ORGANIC OLIVE OIL</b> - Antioxidant packed including squalene that is the best for fighting free radical damage in the skin. Amazing for balancing sebaceous glands for both oily and dry skin. (please always avoid products with shark derived squalene - no need to harm our ocean animals for our benefit!) <br><b>ORGANIC SHEA BUTTER</b> - High concentration of fatty acids and vitamins to soften the skin. Has anti-inflammatory and healing properties to condition, tone and soothe the skin. Our shea butter is unique because it is special filtered to remove any naturally occurring latex found in the kernel of the shea nut which can be known to break out skin.<br><b>LOCAL BEESWAX</b> - The ultimate anti-inflammatory and encourages wound healing. Protective by forming a barrier between the skin and the environment without clogging pores. High in vitamin A, which can support cell reconstruction. Beeswax also attracts water molecules keeping your skin ultra hydrated and an antibacterial so perfect for the face!<br><b>ORGANIC POMEGRANATE SEED OIL</b> -   Has high amounts of punicic acid which increases collagen production to fight against skin aging. Oleic Acids improves radiance and a wrinkle fighter. Linoleic Acid is a major skin soother to calm acne prone skin and reduces future breakouts! Lets give so much gratitude for pomegranate seed oil -  It takes over 200 pounds of fresh pomegranates seeds to produce just one pound of pomegranate seed oil! We use the tiniest amount and you're still getting one whole pomegranate in every 2 oz jar - Nature is cray!The perfect medley for a calm, happy, and healthy face! </p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="2" data-key="content" class="plus iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1585856959285-2" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1585856959285-2" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><p><b>USES</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="2" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1585857113058" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1585857113058"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Use in the am on face before sunscreen and/or apply in the pm after washing face and right before bed. This is a face lotion but is also multi-purpose and due to its anti inflammatory, anti microbial, and nourishing properties, it has also been used to calm rashes, irritations and burns, to remove make up, to alleviate eczema &amp; acne flare ups, hydrate dry to severely dry skin, fade hyperpigmentation, to balance oily skin, dry, cracked spots for your pets etc... <br><br>Every ingredient has a purpose! &nbsp;Store in a cool, dry area at room temp. </p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="3" data-key="content" class="plus iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1585856959285-3" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1585856959285-3" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><p><b>FOOTPRINT</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="3" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1585857150724" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1585857150724"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>All ingredients are sourced responsibly. The beeswax supports hardworking sustainable beekeepers who put the bees first. Pomegranate seed oil, shea butter, and olive oil are organic and supports healthy soils and productions. We aim to focus on organic and fair trade items.</p><p>We ship in post consumer, recyclable and compostable cardboard boxes with paper kraft tape and dissolvable/compostable corn packing peanuts. Just throw the peanuts in water if you don't have a use for them!</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Product Reviews" id="m-1585860514573" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-shopify_reviews" data-ver="1" data-id="1585860514573" data-c